comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-20T15:23:22.692Z","harness:claude-code","Prior art: pm-bukwmy (closed) rejects repository-local scratch roots for the test harness. The benchmark fixture generator never adopted that guard, and the fix should reuse its check instead of adding a second one."
